    "notes": [
      "Single source of truth for the web app (web/src/app/tokens.css, web/src/lib/design-tokens.ts) and the CLI palette (apps/cli/packages/cli/src/ui/themes/lal-palette.ts). Edit here, then run `npm run tokens` at the repo root.",
      "Brand colors are taken from the logo (design/logo.svg): gold #E2CF00, olive #AEB421, leaf #648D50, moss #558559, pine #437C65. Leaf/moss/pine are below 4.5:1 as small text on the dark surfaces, so they are used for fills, borders and gradients; text uses lifted steps of the same hues (leafText #7FA86A, pineText #6FA38C).",
      "Chart palette: logo hues stepped into the dark-mode chart band (OKLCH L 0.48-0.67, C >= 0.10) plus contrasting hues, validated with the dataviz skill's validate_palette.js on #1B1E1C: all checks pass, worst adjacent CVD dE 8.1. Assign in this order, never cycled.",
      "Warning is amber #E59A4B, deliberately distinct from the gold brand/focus/active color."
    ]
  },
